1
00:00:01,620 --> 00:00:07,040
Using Language Reading and Discussing

2
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:09,500
Come and Eat Here 2

3
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:15,560
A week later, Vang Pong's restaurant was nearly full and he felt happier.

4
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:21,140
Perhaps he would be able to earn his living after all and not have to close his restaurant.

5
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:26,620
He did not look forward to being in debt because his restaurant was no longer popular.

6
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:37,920
She did not look happy but glared at him.

7
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:42,160
May I ask what you were doing in my restaurant the other day?

8
00:00:43,020 --> 00:00:47,920
I thought you were a new customer and now I know that you only came to spy on me

9
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,080
and my menu," she shouted.

10
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:53,840
Please excuse me," he calmly explained, "

11
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:57,720
I wanted to know where all my customers had gone last week.

12
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,660
I followed one of them and found them in your restaurant.’

13
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,240
I don’t want to upset you,

14
00:01:04,240 --> 00:01:10,760
but I found your menu so limited that I stopped worrying and started advertising the benefits of my food.

15
00:01:38,180 --> 00:01:42,420
Yes," he added, "and I would miss my dumplings and fatty pork.

16
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:45,080
Don’t you get tired quickly?

17
00:01:49,670 --> 00:01:52,580
But don’t you think it would be better if you were a bit thinner?

18
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:57,740
I’m sure you’d feel much healthier." They began to talk about menus

19
00:01:57,740 --> 00:01:58,740
and balanced diets.

20
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:26,080
They served raw vegetables with the hamburgers and boiled the potatoes rather than frying them.

21
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,980
They served fresh fruit with the ice cream.

22
00:02:42,620 --> 00:02:48,480
After some time the two found that their business cooperation had turned into a personal one.

23
00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:52,760
Finally they got married and lived happily ever after.
